```

## Notes
- Processes items without embeddings (null embedding column)
- Uses batch API for efficiency (50 items at a time)
- Rate limiting to avoid API limits (500ms between batches)
- Continues on errors (doesn't abort entire backfill)
- Shows progress and stats

